<h2>AI Usage</h2>
<p>
  AI tools are used in making this site. Here is where they are used, and what stays in human hands.
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Composition and design</strong> AI is used for writing assistance, rules clarification and
    balance checks, and evaluation and comparison of options. Human review and direction are always
    part of the process on this site.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Artwork</strong> AI is used to generate the images on this site. Human review and input
    are part of the process for each image.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Technology</strong> AI is used for the generation, maintenance, and features of the site.
    Human review and direction are always part of the process on this site.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  Because this site, its rules, and its artwork are provided free of charge under the ORC license,
  AI is used to help in the process. We strongly believe that when revenue is being generated, AI
  usage should be limited or restricted, and that humans should be paid for the unique insights,
  artistry, and skill sets they bring to a project.
</p>
